        "created_at": "2011-10-13T00:29:49.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not to mention there apparently wasn’t a fight in this latest incident… The disappointing part of this is that now it’ll be very hard for him to go on superheroing, since his real name has been released.</p>",
